---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="wrap hero">
  <figure class="hero__portrait">
    <img src="/assets/img/george-portrait.jpg" width="720" height="960"
         alt="George di Giovanni.">
  </figure>

  <div>
    <h1 class="hero__name">{{ site.name }}</h1>
    <p class="hero__title">{{ site.title }}</p>

    <ul class="tag-row">
      {% for t in site.tags %}<li class="tag">{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>

    <div class="hero__welcome prose">
      <p>George di Giovanni is Professor of Philosophy Emeritus at McGill University
      (Montréal), where he taught for over fifty years. His mentors are Emil Fackenheim
      and H. S. Harris. Classical German Philosophy and the Philosophy of Religion are
      his areas of special interest, but he has also lectured extensively on
      Kierkegaard and French phenomenology.</p>
      <p>He authored <em>Freedom and Religion in Kant and his Immediate Successors</em>
      (2005), <em>Hegel and the Challenge of Spinoza</em> (2021), and numerous other
      studies on figures of the later German Enlightenment and early Romanticism. He is
      the editor and translator of numerous texts of Jacobi, Kant, and Hegel, including
      Hegel’s <em>Greater Logic</em> (2010).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <h2 class="section-title">Most recent books</h2>
  <ul class="book-grid">
    {% for b in books %}{% if b.featured %}
    <li>
      <a class="book-card" href="/books/#{{ b.title | slugify }}">
        {% if b.cover %}
        <span class="book-card__cover book-card__cover--image">
          <img src="/assets/img/{{ b.cover }}" alt="Cover of {{ b.title }}" loading="lazy">
        </span>
        {% else %}
        <span class="book-card__cover">
          <span class="book-card__cover-role">{{ b.role }}</span>
          <span class="book-card__cover-body">
            <span class="book-card__cover-title">{{ b.title }}</span>
            <span class="book-card__cover-rule"></span>
            {% if b.subtitle %}<span class="book-card__cover-sub">{{ b.subtitle }}</span>{% endif %}
          </span>
          <span class="book-card__cover-pub">{{ b.publisher }}<br>{{ b.year }}</span>
        </span>
        {% endif %}
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <div class="prose home-notes">
    <p>Regarding the translation of Hegel’s <em>Greater Logic</em>, readers have kindly
    alerted me to a number of errors. Most are innocuous, but two are serious. I have
    documented all in three notes published in the <em>Owl of Minerva</em>; see
    <a href="/notes/">here</a>.</p>
    <p>For some reflections on
    <a href="/assets/pdf/2016-how-necessary-is-the-phenomenology.pdf">Hegel’s Logic</a> and
    <a href="/assets/pdf/2016-hegel-on-religion.pdf">Hegel’s idea of Religion</a>, go to the
    indicated links.</p>
    <p>Video of a presentation on the occasion of the 250th anniversary of Hegel’s birth,
    August 2020, can be found <a href="/video/">here</a>.</p>
    <p>An abbreviated CV can be found
    <a href="/assets/pdf/cv-george-di-giovanni.pdf">here</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:var(--space-lg)"><a href="/books/">All books, translations and edited volumes →</a></p>
</section>
